@page "/about"

<PageTitle>About - AI Personal Finance Tracker</PageTitle>

<div class="page-intro">
    <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">ABOUT THE PLATFORM</p>
        <h1>Financial clarity, built privately</h1>
        <p class="page-subtitle">A personal finance workspace that turns everyday money activity into useful, understandable decisions.</p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row g-4">
    <div class="col-lg-8">
        <div class="surface-panel h-100">
            <h2>What is AI Personal Finance Tracker?</h2>
            <p>This platform helps individuals and households capture transactions, understand spending, set goals, monitor budgets, and make better financial decisions from one workspace.</p>
            <p class="mb-0">It combines a Blazor WebAssembly interface, an ASP.NET Core API, SQLite persistence, and ML.NET intelligence. Your financial records stay in the application rather than being sent to an advertising or social platform.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-lg-4">
        <div class="surface-panel h-100">
            <h2>Built for</h2>
            <ul class="mb-0">
                <li>Students and first-time budgeters</li>
                <li>Professionals and freelancers</li>
                <li>Families managing shared budgets</li>
                <li>Anyone tracking money across currencies</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row g-4 mt-1">
    <div class="col-md-6"><div class="surface-panel h-100"><h2>Money management</h2><p class="mb-0">Create transactions manually, use Smart Add, import CSV/XLSX history, upload receipts, filter your ledger, configure categories, and export your records.</p></div></div>
    <div class="col-md-6"><div class="surface-panel h-100"><h2>AI and ML intelligence</h2><p class="mb-0">Automatic category suggestions, cash-flow forecasts, anomaly risk scoring, recurring-payment analysis, and a contextual financial advisor turn records into practical guidance.</p></div></div>
    <div class="col-md-6"><div class="surface-panel h-100"><h2>Goals and planning</h2><p class="mb-0">Track savings goals, monthly budgets, category limits, projected overruns, and fixed-cost burn rate. Download a monthly PDF report for a portable summary.</p></div></div>
    <div class="col-md-6"><div class="surface-panel h-100"><h2>International by design</h2><p class="mb-0">Choose from international currencies, view values in your base currency, and convert stored financial amounts using live exchange rates when your profile currency changes.</p></div></div>
</div>

<div class="surface-panel mt-4">
    <h2>Privacy and security</h2>
    <p>Passwords are stored as salted PBKDF2 hashes. Authentication, profile preferences, transactions, goals, and reports are handled by the application API. The platform is designed for personal use; always deploy it behind HTTPS, use persistent protected storage, and configure production email and secrets before public launch.</p>
    <p class="text-muted mb-0">This application provides financial organization and insights, not regulated investment, tax, or legal advice.</p>
</div>
